    "finding": "The declared p95 limit of 16.67 ms is 0.0033 ms below the 16.6667 ms period of a 60 FPS cap. Half of a capped run is already at that period, so p95 is at or above the limit before any jitter is considered. The limit is therefore unreachable under a 60 FPS cap regardless of how well the build performs.",
